InTheChest: in the chest
BreakTheChest: break the chest
MineIt: mine it
CutWith: cut with {0}
DrunkWorld: drunk world only
SurfaceChests: Surface chests
SurfaceChestsBody: In wooden chests just under the surface, from world creation
UndergroundChests: Underground chests
GoldChestBody: Gold Chests stand in underground caves, cabins and pyramids from world creation; empty one and break it with a pickaxe
JungleChests: Jungle chests
IvyChestBody: These chests stand in jungle shrines and living mahogany trees from world creation; empty one and break it with a pickaxe
JungleChestsBody: In the chests of jungle shrines and living mahogany trees below the cavern layer, from world creation
SpiderCaves: Spider caves
WebCoveredChestBody: These chests stand in spider caves from world creation; empty one and break it with a pickaxe
WebSlingerBody: Every web-covered chest in the spider caves holds one from world creation
Underwater: Underwater chests
WaterChestBody: These chests lie under water, in ocean caves and deep pools, from world creation; empty one and break it with a pickaxe
TrappedChests: Trapped chests underground
DeadMansChestBody: A few underground Gold Chests become this one, wired to dart traps, boulders and explosives; disarm the traps, empty it and break it with a pickaxe
DeadMansSweaterBody: One trapped chest in three holds it from world creation
IceChests: Ice biome chests
IceChestsBody: In the chests of the underground ice biome below the cavern layer, from world creation
DesertChests: Underground desert chests
DesertChestsBody: In the chests of the underground desert below the cavern layer, from world creation
LivingTrees: Living tree chests
LivingTreesBody: In the chest of the room under a living tree, from world creation
MushroomChests: Mushroom biome chests
MushroomChestsBody: In the chests of mushroom biome cabins, from world creation
MushroomSetBody: In the chests of mushroom biome cabins, the whole set together: 1 chest in 3 above the cavern layer, 1 in 2 below it
AnyChests: Any chest
MoonLordLegsBody: In a drunk world (seed 05162020), 1 chest in 15 gets one when the world is made
Caves: Underground caves
DartTrapBody: Dart traps wait in underground caves and by trapped chests, wired to pressure plates; break one with a pickaxe
LavaCaves: Caverns near the lava
GeyserBody: Geysers stand on the floor of the deepest caverns, near the lava, from world creation; break one with a pickaxe
OreDeposits: Rigged ore deposits
DetonatorBody: In the caverns an explosive sits on an ore deposit, wired to a Detonator a few blocks away; break the Detonator with a pickaxe
Pyramids: Pyramids
PyramidsBody: Hangs in a desert pyramid from world creation; break it with a pickaxe to pick it up
SkyIslands: Sky island houses
SkyIslandsBody: Hangs in a sky island house from world creation; break it with a pickaxe to pick it up
Cabins: Underground cabins
CabinsBody: Hangs on the wall of an underground cabin (wood, ice, jungle, mushroom, granite or marble) from world creation; break it with a pickaxe to pick it up
DesertHouses: Underground desert houses
DesertHousesBody: Hangs on the wall of a house in the underground desert from world creation; break it with a pickaxe to pick it up
Dirt: Dirt across the world
DirtiestBlockBody: When the world is made, a few dirt blocks (3 in a small world, 6 in a medium one, 9 in a large one) become this block; mine it
CaveMoss: Long moss in the caverns
CaveMossBody: Long moss grows in the caverns on moss of the same kind; cut it with a {0}: one tuft in nine drops this moss
